      <div style={{"background":"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)","border":"1px solid rgba(107,92,231,0.25)","borderRadius":"16px","padding":"2rem"}}><div style={{"fontSize":"2rem","marginBottom":"1rem"}}>💬</div><h3 style={{"fontFamily":"Syne,sans-serif","fontSize":"1rem","fontWeight":"700","marginBottom":"0.5rem"}}>Closed Captions &amp; Transcripts</h3><p style={{"fontSize":"0.88rem","color":"rgba(255,255,255,0.6)","lineHeight":"1.65"}}>Every video includes accurate captions and downloadable transcripts for deaf and hard-of-hearing learners.</p></div>
      <div style={{"background":"rgba(255,255,255,0.05)","border":"1px solid rgba(107,92,231,0.25)","borderRadius":"16px","padding":"2rem"}}><div style={{"fontSize":"2rem","marginBottom":"1rem"}}>🖊️</div><h3 style={{"fontFamily":"Syne,sans-serif","fontSize":"1rem","fontWeight":"700","marginBottom":"0.5rem"}}>Adjustable Reading Tools</h3><p style={{"fontSize":"0.88rem","color":"rgba(255,255,255,0.6)","lineHeight":"1.65"}}>Font size, spacing, dyslexia-friendly typefaces, and high-contrast modes for learners with reading disabilities.</p></div>
